This aircraft is derived from the "advanced_plane" simulation model that ships with
PX4-Autopilot (Tools/simulation/gz/models/advanced_plane), and carries that model's
geometry, mass, aerodynamic and propulsion data. Its meshes are the source model's
own -- which that model in turn takes from rc_cessna -- converted to glTF.

